      briefReview: "Castelhano peninsular: 5 vogais plenas, distinção /θ/–/s/ (e o seseo, norma culta na América Latina), yeísmo, /ð/ fricativo, RR vibrante múltiplo, J/G /x/ velar; entonação e shadowing diário. Acentuação gráfica: agudas, llanas e esdrújulas, tilde diacrítica, hiatos e as normas da RAE de 2010 (solo, guion).",
      briefReviewEn: "Peninsular Spanish: five full vowels, the /θ/–/s/ distinction (and seseo, the educated norm in Latin America), yeísmo, fricative /ð/, trilled RR, velar J/G /x/; intonation and daily shadowing. Written accents: agudas, llanas and esdrújulas, the diacritic accent, hiatuses and the RAE's 2010 rules (solo, guion).",
